      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "When you infuse a weapon, you can add an additional +1 worth of weapon qualities to that weapon; this could either be used to increase a weapon infused to be a +1 weapon to be a +2 weapon, or to grant a weapon quality like flaming, defending, keen, or any other +1 quality from the Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook. This effect occurs automatically as you infuse a weapon, but you may only do so to one weapon you wield at a time."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Special",
        "body_raw": "You may take this feat more than once; each time you do, the limit to the number of weapons on which you can simultaneously use Improved Infuse Weapon increases by 2."
      }
